# Workflow Overview

1. Update data splits whenever JSONL sources change:
   python split_dataset.py --source enhanced_boxing_dataset.jsonl --source singleton.jsonl [--source new_file.jsonl]

2. Train the CodeBERT classifier using the prepared split directories:
   python train_code_for_mac.py

3. (Optional) Benchmark multiple models on the same splits:
   python discover_model.py --epochs 3 --train-batch-size 2 --eval-batch-size 2 [--test-dir separate_test_dir]

Outputs:
- Split datasets stored in train_dataset/ and test_dataset/
- Trained model stored in boxing-classifier-final/
- Benchmark artifacts saved under discover_model_outputs/
